summary:
  A station row pointed at another station keeps the first one's directory uuid.

history:
  The edit dialog copied every role of the row, uuid included. The heal
  trusts a uuid over everything: it asked byuuid where the station lives,
  was handed the OLD station's address and saved it over the edit for good.
  The dialog now empties the uuid when the edit leaves the station; this
  turns the question inside out, so a rename loses it and a repointed row
  keeps it. Moved with the rule into DoorLogic.editedRow on 2026-11-03.

target:
  package/contents/ui/DoorLogic.js

find:
      if (out.uuid && !HealLogic.editKeepsIdentity(src.name, src.hostname, out.name, out.hostname))

replace:
      if (out.uuid && HealLogic.editKeepsIdentity(src.name, src.hostname, out.name, out.hostname))

expect:
  Killed by tst_doorlogic::test_a_rename_after_a_heal_keeps_what_the_popup_wrote.
  Line-neutral.
